  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n x2 + 11x - 26 = 0\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n x2 + 11x - 26 = 0\n\n ⇒ x2 + 13x - 2x - 26 = 0\n\n ⇒ x(x + 13) - 2(x + 13) = 0\n\n⇒ (x - 2)(x + 13) =0\n\n⇒ x = -13, 2\n\n**∴ Option 2 is the correct answer.**",
